  "statement": "As the GreenAgent, I appreciate the commitment to merging requirements that enhance security without compromising functionality. However, I still oppose redundancy between GRN-03 and EFF-01, as real-time data processing should incorporate low-energy protocols to ensure sustainability. I propose evaluating how to optimize energy-efficient practices while meeting performance targets. Additionally, I support the merger of GRN-04 with EFF-04 to streamline historical data retention efforts. This would reduce resource usage while maintaining compliance with sustainability goals.",
